Z||000008||FieroFanaticus2||11-27-2001||09:38 PM||||Anybody interested in plexiglass PLEASE EMAIL ME.  This way I have something to remind me who wants it.  It's hard to get on and try to follow posts and think 'who did i reply to about this, and what did I say to them', so PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE email me about it.<P>I Like the diplay you got going as well!  Maybe I'll do something similar once I get my new carpet in, and finish installing those side scoops I got from Ferarri momo last spring, and those electric windows and locks need finishing too, damn, forgot about the sunroof swap and the scoops for the front and rear decklids.  I think I've overloaded myself!!!  No wonder my girlfriend is pissed at me.||||reg||1
Z||000009||FieroPerformance||11-27-2001||10:07 PM||||Alright, here are some details that you should know if you want to make something similar to what I made.<P>First of all I an going to cut a piece of gray carpet to lay over it for when I put stuff in the trunk on top of it. Planning on putting things on top of it I decided to use two pieces of pli-wood. The shape is exactly the same, however the windows holes on the lower board are slightly smaller all the way around. I had the plexi glass cut to the size of the openings on the top board. I then glued the two boards together (the one with smaller openings on the bottoms), once this was done the plexi glass can sit in its hole and be supported by the lip of the lower board that is sticking out. I could not get plexi glass that was the same thickness as the top board so I used 2 pieces stacked on top of eachother. I then filled in the gaps around the edge of the glass with a wood repair compound that can be painted and sanded. After sanding it all evenly I taped off the glass so that enough would get painted to make straight lines and cover where you could see the lip of the lower board.<P>I think this just about sums it up. It took some time to get it fitted correctly so it would sit across the two high spots in the trunk. I can take measurements, if you would like me to just let me know. <P>I will have it at the Ohio Fiero thing this Saturday if I make it up there.<P>-Charlie<BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
